.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-vpc-subnet-create - Add a subnet


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro vpc subnet create  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a subnet

.PP
/20 to /28 inside the VPC range, not overlapping another subnet. Give \fBcidr\fR, or \fBprefix\fR (default 24) for the next free range. In every subnet .1 is the gateway; .0-.4 and the last address are reserved.

.PP
API: POST /cloud/vpcs/{vpc_id}/subnets (operationId createVpcSubnet, scope cloud_write)


